      "message": "For reference the proto \u0027style\u0027 recommendation, https://protobuf.dev/best-practices/dos-donts/\n\n(I am aware we already deviate from these, due to not reserving unspecified \u003d 0 in our enums, but if we are going to create effective a v2 of the proto, I would like to do it intentionally)",
